#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FixExtensions), group (Options)
#: app/settings.kcfg:30
#, kde-format
msgid "Save in standard web archive format"
msgstr "Spremi u standardnom formatu web-arhive"

#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry (FixExtensions), group (Options)
#: app/settings.kcfg:37
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Save downloaded files all in a single directory, with file name "
"extensions suitable for local browsing.\n"
"                        For example, the main HTML page will always be "
"called \"index.html\" and a remote .php page will be saved with the "
"standard .html extension.</p>\n"
"               <p>Leave this option turned on to produce a standard web "
"archive (.war) file.</p>\n"
"               <p>If this option is turned off, then the files will be saved "
"exactly as downloaded.\n"
"                        This means that they may be in subdirectories "
"reflecting the structure of the original web site, and extensions will not "
"be adjusted.\n"
"                        Note that the download may not work correctly if the "
"original URL refers to a directory but does not end with a slash.</p>\n"
"      "
msgstr "<p>Spremi sve preuzete datoteke u jedan direktorij, s nastavcima naziva datoteka prikladnima za lokalno pregledavanje.\n                        Primjerice, glavna HTML stranica uvijek će se zvati „index.html”, a udaljena PHP stranica spremit će se sa standardnim nastavkom „.html”.</p>\n               <p>Ostavite ovu mogućnost uključenu kako biste stvorili standardnu datoteku web-arhive (.war).</p>\n               <p>Ako je ova mogućnost isključena, datoteke će se spremiti točno onako kako su preuzete.\n                        To znači da mogu biti u poddirektorijima koji odražavaju strukturu izvorne web-stranice te da im se nastavci neće prilagoditi.\n                        Imajte na umu da preuzimanje možda neće ispravno raditi ako izvorni URL upućuje na direktorij, ali ne završava kosom crtom.</p>\n      "

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (RunInTerminal), group (Options)
#: app/settings.kcfg:42
#, kde-format
msgid "Run in terminal"
msgstr "Pokreni u terminalu"

#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry (RunInTerminal), group (Options)
#: app/settings.kcfg:45
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Run the download process in a terminal window. Close the terminal window "
"when the download has finished.</p>\n"
"               <p>If this option is turned off then the download will run in "
"the background. Its progress output should appear in the session log file.</"
"p>\n"
"      "
msgstr "<p>Pokreni proces preuzimanja u prozoru terminala. Zatvori prozor terminala kada preuzimanje završi.</p>\n               <p>Ako je ova mogućnost isključena, preuzimanje će se odvijati u pozadini. Ispis napretka trebao bi se pojaviti u datoteci zapisnika sesije.</p>\n      "

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (CloseWhenFinished), group (Options)
#: app/settings.kcfg:50
#, kde-format
msgid "Close when finished"
msgstr "Zatvori po završetku"

#. i18n: ectx: tooltip, entry (CloseWhenFinished), group (Options)
#: app/settings.kcfg:51
#, kde-format
msgid "Close this window when the download has finished successfully"
msgstr "Zatvori ovaj prozor kada preuzimanje uspješno završi"

